{"title":"2024 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a sequence of integers, the 1st term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Each new term is obtained by adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the previous term. In this sequence, the first four terms are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the 20th term?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can come up with a general formula for any value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> first.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/93458776a258e5271d500e7cc038c8b594f89cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = mn + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> represents the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of the sequence.\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970c67d43e2cd7f3e62f1e9afeb5d18508c8dd34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 6$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> because the common difference, which is the number added to the previous term in the sequence, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We then have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/040c0b6a6acac4e4bc149e7866489f636ce44827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = 6n + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>We can also now use the fact that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />st term of the sequence was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f87b50a3b687f7c46b2f38ebaddc62e23db12ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 3 = 6 \\times 1 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0106ece67669221d931628f60b6f6b567dcc30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = 6 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/87060766e9ebb991a41c70ab0ff37075b516b3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3 - 6 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/a/6fae94cfaac913dfe463409e9f65e7b21b5939d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = 6n - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb6a07a7c20f6b35462de06a47e8672ea360ca79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/e/c1e26486b1c42071fae6961d2a367bc570df0633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(20) = 6 \\times 20 - 3 = 120 - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"233\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/46308cac1df0121af34a56e0a7b6d64b9a6390ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we need to add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times to the first term in the sequence to get the 20th term. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb88edfcaa1827027a7f6844f1d802ac50a11930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20} = a_1 + 6 \\times 19 = 3 + 6 \\times 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"244\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f04dd7c2eea52722f99927d0409ae4492fdc76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 3 + 114 = \\boxed{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"142\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 430/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4944/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.192      1 2024_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    8.192      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35043:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025717 and revision id 272010. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}